{"4024130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Charm&Clue", "steam_appid": 4024130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Charm &amp; Clue - a new adventure full of mysteries and secrets, where every step leads to unexpected discoveries. The atmosphere of the 50s and 60s comes to life in luxurious interiors, winter streets and concert halls filled with spotlights and shadows of the past. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stories about a living doll, dark intrigues behind the scenes of a restaurant concert, fascinating and magical illusions under the dome of an observatory await you. A mansion with an unusual guest, a police station and circus festivals - all this hides secrets and challenges that you have to solve. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a casual “search for objects” game with mini-puzzles. In each scene, you search for a list of hidden objects in the classic hidden object format; there are variations in tasks and additional types of puzzles - coloring, several types of puzzles, finding differences, and others. Become a detective in a world where reality intertwines with magic, and the answer is always closer than it seems. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charm &amp; Clue is waiting for you - are you ready to reveal all the secrets?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Charm &amp; Clue - a new adventure full of mysteries and secrets, where every step leads to unexpected discoveries. The atmosphere of the 50s and 60s comes to life in luxurious interiors, winter streets and concert halls filled with spotlights and shadows of the past. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stories about a living doll, dark intrigues behind the scenes of a restaurant concert, fascinating and magical illusions under the dome of an observatory await you. A ma